  "method": "closed loop over the async Videos job API: each request = POST /v1/videos (create) -> poll GET /v1/videos/{id} every poll_interval_s until terminal -> GET .../content -> DELETE; latency = create start -> content downloaded (DELETE excluded), so it is quantised by the poll interval; throughput = successes / level wall; the same single FIFO + one resident worker as the sync path, so c>1 measures queueing (jobs wait server-side without an open connection), not parallel execution; burst = N creates back to back then poll"
